stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING : Order placed (COD)
  PENDING --> CONFIRMED : Manager confirms
  PENDING --> CANCELLED : Customer / manager cancels
  CONFIRMED --> PROCESSING : Items being packed
  PROCESSING --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY : Assigned to delivery agent
  OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> DELIVERED : Customer receives & pays cash
  OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> FAILED_DELIVERY : Customer unreachable / refused
  FAILED_DELIVERY --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY : Re-attempt delivery
  FAILED_DELIVERY --> RETURNED : Return to store
  DELIVERED --> RETURN_REQUESTED : Customer requests return
  RETURN_REQUESTED --> RETURNED : Return approved & collected
  DELIVERED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  RETURNED --> [*]
